<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Buyer Home | FakrudeenMart</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/css/style.css"></head><body><main class="buyer-shell"><header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/buyer/home">FAKRUDEENMART</a><nav aria-label="Buyer navigation"><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/buyer/home">Home</a><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/products#search">Shop</a><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/products#categories">Categories</a><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/products#search">Search</a><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/cart">Cart</a><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/orders">Orders</a><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/products#reviews">Reviews</a><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/buyer/account">My Account</a><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/logout">Logout</a></nav></header><section class="buyer-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Buyer home</p><h1>Welcome, <c:out value="${sessionScope.userName}"/>.</h1><p>Shop the live marketplace, manage your cart, track orders, and share verified product experiences.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="primary-link" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/products">Shop products</a><a class="secondary-link" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/orders">View orders</a></div></section><section class="buyer-module-grid" aria-label="Buyer modules"><article><span class="value-number">01</span><h2>Shop</h2><p>Search, filter, sort, compare, and explore product details.</p><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/products">Browse catalog →</a></article><article><span class="value-number">02</span><h2>Cart & checkout</h2><p>Review server-calculated totals and place secure orders.</p><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/cart">Open cart →</a></article><article><span class="value-number">03</span><h2>Orders & reviews</h2><p>Follow order history and review products you purchased.</p><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/orders">Open order history →</a></article></section></main><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/js/app.js" defer></script></body></html>
